pan begin="00:22.717" end="00:23.073">E</span><span begin="00:23.073" end="00:23.242">very</span><span begin="00:23.242" end="00:23.899">thing</span> <span begin="00:23.899" end="00:24.101">just</span> <span begin="00:24.101" end="00:24.309">looks</span> <span begin="00:24.309" end="00:24.737">beau</span><span begin="00:24.737" end="00:24.921">ti</span><span begin="00:24.921" end="00:25.371">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切皆美得令人心安</span></p><p begin="00:26.227" end="00:27.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:26.227" end="00:26.424">It's</span> <span begin="00:26.424" end="00:26.614">o</span><span begin="00:26.614" end="00:27.132">kay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无妨</span></p><p begin="00:28.114" end="00:30.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:28.114" end="00:28.304">The</span> <span begin="00:28.304" end="00:28.734">sun</span><span begin="00:28.734" end="00:29.127">shine</span> <span begin="00:29.127" end="00:29.782">keeps</span> <span begin="00:29.782" end="00:30.429">fal</span><span begin="00:30.429" end="00:30.832">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">暖阳倾泻不息</span></p><p begin="00:32.959" end="00:38.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:32.959" end="00:33.137">Lone</span><span begin="00:33.137" end="00:33.377">li</span><span begin="00:33.377" end="00:34.009">ness</span> <span begin="00:34.627" end="00:34.827">does</span><span begin="00:34.827" end="00:35.054">n't</span> <span begin="00:35.054" end="00:36.494">stay</span> <span begin="00:36.494" end="00:37.215">for</span> <span begin="00:37.215" end="00:38.880">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孤寂从不长驻</span></p><p begin="00:39.607" end="00:43.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:39.607" end="00:39.847">E</span><span begin="00:39.847" end="00:40.045">very</span><span begin="00:40.045" end="00:41.097">thing</span> <span begin="00:41.097" end="00:41.945">just</